hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1368","Muhammad bin Muammar bin Rabi’ al-Qaisi told us, Amr bin Khalifa al-Bakrawi told us, Ash’ath told us, on the authority of al-Hasan, on the authority of Abu Bakra: The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, led the people with the Maghrib prayer, three rak’ahs, then he left, and the others came and he led three rak’ahs with them, and it was For the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, there are six rak’ahs, and for the people there are three.”"
